Authors: J. Tepperman, W. Teller

Version 1.10 -- Fixed all known problems with the EXITCPD menu.  The [S]end Esc
                option was removed, as it was no longer needed.  CPDS (the
                configuration program), was made more concise (i.e. it now
                shows a protocol name, not just a letter or number).  In 
                addition both the configuration program and the EXITCPD menu
                both support "lightbars" for easier option selection.
                
Version 1.00 -- Initial Release.

